  <h2>Branding is the Differentiator</h2>
  <p>In the premium activewear segment, the difference between a "generic product" and a "luxury brand" often lies in the quality of the finish. For established sellers looking to expand their collections without the MOQ of custom dyeing, our <strong>Premium Branding Program</strong> is the answer.</p>

  <img src="https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/He70e1aafb8294b84a3c6f1b1b7b247f6s.png" alt="Fitclo Custom Branding Capabilities: Labels, Tags, and Packaging" class="w-full rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-xl" />

  <h3>Precision Logo & Monogram Integration</h3>
  <p>We utilize the latest in <strong>Logo Printing Technology</strong> to ensure your brand mark survives high-intensity workouts and 100+ wash cycles. Whether you require a subtle tonal monogram or a high-visibility reflective logo for night running, our factory-direct application ensures zero peel-off.</p>

  <img src="https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/H07668ee69ffd44f0aec26e4728e84a05y.png" alt="Fitclo Logo Printing Technologies: Reflective, Silicone, and Puff" class="w-full rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-xl" />

  <h3>The Secondary Brand Signals: Labels & Tags</h3>
  <p>High-value customers look for professional trim. We offer a comprehensive suite of customization for established brands:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Custom Woven Labels:</strong> Soft-touch neck labels that won't irritate the skin.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical Hang Tags:</strong> Multi-layer, embossed, or transparent tags that communicate your brand values.</li>
    <li><strong>Branded Wash Care:</strong> Heat-transfer or TPU labels for a seamless interior.</li>
  </ul>

